---
import LegalLayout from '../components/LegalLayout.astro';
import Val from '../components/Val.astro';
import CancellationPolicy from '../components/CancellationPolicy.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
const d = site.legalDetails;
const email = site.contact.email;
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="The terms for using the Thehraav Counselling website and booking online counselling sessions, in plain language."
>
  <p>
    These terms explain how this website and our online counselling sessions work. By using the site or booking a
    session, you agree to them. If anything is unclear, please <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>About the service</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Thehraav Counselling offers online, one-to-one counselling with {site.psychologist.name}, counselling
      psychologist, in English and Hindi.
    </li>
    <li>
      Counselling is a collaborative process. It can help a great deal, but results can't be guaranteed, and progress
      depends on many things.
    </li>
    <li>
      Counselling is not a medical or psychiatric service and doesn't replace one. Sarah doesn't diagnose medical
      conditions or prescribe medication. If you need those, she may suggest other professionals.
    </li>
    <li>Sessions are for adults aged <Val v={d.minimumAge} /> and over.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Not an emergency service</h2>
  <p>
    This website, email and WhatsApp are not monitored around the clock and are not for emergencies. If you're in
    crisis, please call Tele-MANAS on <a href="tel:14416">14416</a> (free, 24/7), call <a href="tel:112">112</a>, or go
    to your nearest emergency service.
  </p>

  <h2>Booking and payment</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Sessions are booked through Cal ID, our booking tool.</li>
    <li>New clients can book one free first session.</li>
    <li>
      Regular sessions cost <Val v={site.sessions.fee} /> for <Val v={site.sessions.length} /> and are paid in full when
      you book, through Razorpay. Your booking is confirmed once payment is successful.
    </li>
    <li>Fees may change in future. Any change won't affect sessions you've already paid for.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cancelling and rescheduling</h2>
  <CancellationPolicy />
  <p>
    If Sarah needs to cancel, you'll be offered a new time or a full refund.
    Refunds are made through Razorpay to your original payment method.
  </p>

  <h2>Online sessions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Please join from a private, quiet space, using a reliable internet connection.</li>
    <li>Recording sessions isn't allowed by either side without written agreement.</li>
    <li>If the connection drops, rejoin using the same link. If a session can't continue because of technical problems on our side, we'll arrange to make up the time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Confidentiality</h2>
  <p>
    What you share in sessions is kept confidential, within professional ethical guidelines and the law. The limits of
    confidentiality are explained in the consent form you receive after booking. For how your data is handled, see the
    <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Using this website</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Information on this website is general and for information only. It isn't a substitute for personal,
      professional advice.
    </li>
    <li>
      The website links to other services (such as Cal ID, Razorpay and WhatsApp). We're not responsible for their
      content or how they work.
    </li>
    <li>The website's text, design and logo belong to Thehraav Counselling. Please don't copy them without permission.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Our responsibility</h2>
  <p>
    We take care to provide a safe, professional service. To the extent the law allows, we're not responsible for
    losses caused by things outside our reasonable control, such as internet outages or problems with third-party
    services.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes will be handled by the courts of <Val v={d.jurisdiction} />.</p>

  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms from time to time, and the date at the top will show when. Questions? Email
    <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
